{"id":"60079d4c65597855","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-homotopy-lifting.md","title":"Homotopy Lifting","display":"df-homotopy-lifting — Homotopy Lifting","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-homotopy-lifting","aliases":["58-df-homotopy-lifting"],"display":"df-homotopy-lifting — Homotopy Lifting","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[58-df-topological-vector.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-homotopy-lifting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-homotopy-lifting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homotopy-lifting — Homotopy Lifting"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" href=\"?note=cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md\">../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"512a7d4f3a4d640b\" href=\"?note=512a7d4f3a4d640b\" title=\"58-df-topological-vector.md\">58-df-topological-vector.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,E,B,X,H,\\widetilde H_0,\\widetilde H\\in V\">\\(p,E,B,X,H,\\widetilde H_0,\\widetilde H\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,1]\">\\(I=[0,1]\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> (continuity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HLP}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{HLP}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (homotopy-lifting predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\tau_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中固定的拓扑指定函数，约定与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a> 的指定拓扑一致；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,B,X\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau_{(-)})\">\\(E,B,X\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau_{(-)})\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_E,E)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_B,B)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_X,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_E,E)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_B,B)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_X,X)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_I=\\{U\\subseteq I:\\forall t\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in I\\;(|s-t|&lt;\\varepsilon\\to s\\in U)\\}\">\\(\\tau_I=\\{U\\subseteq I:\\forall t\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in I\\;(|s-t|&lt;\\varepsilon\\to s\\in U)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S\\)</span> 取本书二元乘积拓扑函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HLP}_S(p,E,B,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;p\\in B^E\\land\n\\forall H\\in B^{X\\times I}\\;\\forall H_0\\in E^X\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(X,\\tau_X,I,\\tau_I),B,\\tau_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H_0,X,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;p(H_0(x))=H(\\langle x,0\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\widetilde H\\in E^{X\\times I}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H,X\\times I,\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(X,\\tau_X,I,\\tau_I),E,\\tau_E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall t\\in I\\;p(\\widetilde H(\\langle x,t\\rangle))=H(\\langle x,t\\rangle)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\widetilde H(\\langle x,0\\rangle)=H_0(x)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HLP}_S(p,E,B,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;p\\in B^E\\land\n\\forall H\\in B^{X\\times I}\\;\\forall H_0\\in E^X\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(X,\\tau_X,I,\\tau_I),B,\\tau_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H_0,X,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;p(H_0(x))=H(\\langle x,0\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\widetilde H\\in E^{X\\times I}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H,X\\times I,\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(X,\\tau_X,I,\\tau_I),E,\\tau_E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall t\\in I\\;p(\\widetilde H(\\langle x,t\\rangle))=H(\\langle x,t\\rangle)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\widetilde H(\\langle x,0\\rangle)=H_0(x)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Homotopy lifting is the defining lifting property for fibrations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md","status":"resolved","id":"cc1ce993dd3ce56d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-vector.md","status":"resolved","id":"512a7d4f3a4d640b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-vector.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Continuous}_S$ (continuity predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V$ 是 $S$ 中固定的拓扑指定函数，约定与 [[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]] 的指定拓扑一致；$E,B,X\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau_{(-)})$ 且 $\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_E,E)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_B,B)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_X,X)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,E,B,X,H,\\widetilde H_0,\\widetilde H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I=[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HLP}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"E,B,X\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau_{(-)})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_E,E)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_B,B)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_X,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_I=\\{U\\subseteq I:\\forall t\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall s\\in I\\;(|s-t|<\\varepsilon\\to s\\in U)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HLP}_S(p,E,B,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&p\\in B^E\\land\n\\forall H\\in B^{X\\times I}\\;\\forall H_0\\in E^X\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(X,\\tau_X,I,\\tau_I),B,\\tau_B)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H_0,X,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;p(H_0(x))=H(\\langle x,0\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists\\widetilde H\\in E^{X\\times I}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H,X\\times I,\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(X,\\tau_X,I,\\tau_I),E,\\tau_E)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall t\\in I\\;p(\\widetilde H(\\langle x,t\\rangle))=H(\\langle x,t\\rangle)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\widetilde H(\\langle x,0\\rangle)=H_0(x)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1903,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-644","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-homotopy-lifting.md|58-df-homotopy-lifting]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["cc1ce993dd3ce56d","3cd1834de4f2efb2","512a7d4f3a4d640b","050f6d05b2c94aea","e7514bc4cefba4f2"]}